  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MWAHR: United Voices &#x2013; Inclusion and Empowerment of Marginalized Women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MWAHR &#x201c;United Voices &#x2013; Inclusion and Empowerment of Marginalized Women&quot; is the continuation of the project &quot;Equal opportunities for diverse societies&#x201d; (Ref: SE-ON-802401-6134-WB-XK2) under the 2024-2025 programme &#x201c;The Kvinna till Kvinna Regional Programme - Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents&#x201d; (Ref: SE-ON-802401-6134-WB).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Kvinnna till Kvinna Foundation&apos;s regional programme &quot;Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents 2.0&quot; the partner organisation Mitrovica Women Association for Human Rights (MWAHR) is implementing the 8 month project &quot;United Voices &#x2013; Inclusion and Empowerment of Marginalized Women&quot;. The project consists of two main objectives; Promotion of Feminism and Strengthening of Feminist/Human Rights Defender Groups from the Mitrovica region, and Integration of Women from Roma, Ashkali, Egyptian, and Other Vulnerable Groups.</narrative>
  </description>
